{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e2b7764828dd3f1e0e590af3858bc7e11fc0e1001582654199a1bafd6a2e2bba", "ja": "未来、ここにいたのか。\nブログ、代表で書いてくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "未来，你在这啊。\n谢谢你愿意代表大家写部落格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "dbd208b531b92a9658b6777b62e92b04859df9e0c85332e5a0b0a94078cff785", "ja": "あっ、見てもらえたんですね！？\n私のブログ、どうでしたか？　面白かったですか？", "zh": "啊，你看过了啊！？\n我的部落格写得怎么样？有趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1002_p", "source_sha256": "794e4be09060cea45805c29cab1459b6b1fbbd41c2730e15bbee21e5a92ae16e", "ja": "ああ。劇場のみんなの楽しそうな様子が\nよくわかるブログで、よかったと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，能从文章中感受到剧场伙伴们有多开心，\n我觉得写得很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "6e435ba67741972d48150f9095c928a550d83ee8ae1bf2f06842f603c8b9c99f", "ja": "えへへ、やった～♪\n{$P$}さんにほめられちゃいました♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了～♪\n被{$P$}先生夸奖了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "66fc1e81c74d9ee62a6a4436934eb2f7f5e880a96fa70284ae894c803a98ecdb", "ja": "でも未来ってば、いつか全員で\nステージに立ちたいって書いたでしょ～？", "zh": "不过你有写到说，\n希望以后可以所有人一起站上舞台对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "1f01feb0edd8cb7c9b3896e96e2307936e11eb8698bf4e1a39a9431677ad37d8", "ja": "うん！　代わりばんこじゃなくて、765プロの\n全員でずら～っと並んで歌うの♪　すごくない？", "zh": "嗯！不是轮流上场，而是765艺能所有人\n通～通站上去唱歌♪不觉得很棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dca5b676d3f15e1f80a9f8d4ec835f46e1ef0f910665bbfffe5852df5a07818d", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたし達の劇場って\nけっこう狭いし、全員でなんて無理じゃないですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我们的剧场还满小的，\n应该不太可能全都站上台吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "5eeda6117688301e8c926657e9ad8e554d0a26cfca3b9dd4b36748d1fbad82da", "ja": "それは……確かに、そうかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "这……好像确实是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "82fbb8f5729f0da08992f360304ab5e0fda48ec2d458333a1990a40cd3d00078", "ja": "えーっ、できないのー！？\n{$P$}さん、できないんですか！？", "zh": "咦──不行吗～！？\n{$P$}先生，真的不行吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ff9e4715df4a4ec09f94642c0f765cae090b50ef0d25c8969be4110178df674c", "ja": "まあまあ。劇場はもちろんみんなのホームだけど、\nその時は、大きな会場を借りてやればいいんだよ。", "zh": "你别担心，剧场是大家的家没错，\n但到时只要去借更大的会场就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1010_p", "source_sha256": "642553ae695a88a8d4a3ff7c3ca4cc38fdb024b6ca765a59790cb59a24185df9", "ja": "そうだな……たとえば、武道館とか。", "zh": "对了……比方说武道馆之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "382a50c9678ef639dc35542274ac2c3ce9057f6bbd11fd571e6801b918cfd7a1", "ja": "武道館……！\nそれって、手作りの『ぶどーかん』、ですね！？", "zh": "武道馆……！\n是说「亲手打造的『武道馆』」吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1012_p", "source_sha256": "71edcc655eb4d5023980534cf7c376a94fbad7dbe84704857aa86399b77c9011", "ja": "ああ。その武道館だけど、\n手作りじゃなくて、本物の方だ！", "zh": "嗯，是武道馆没错，\n但不是亲手打造的，是要去真正的武道馆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "eddb7d026b6050859e9a33ce7f69edc57707ab07d35ef5440a2578c6e693b110", "ja": "そ、そんな。武道館だなんて……。", "zh": "真、真的吗？武道馆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "3bbb23de5155afb8220ae7078e32e72d43406fa8386816dbcdb3754a7b80a7fd", "ja": "ふふっ、楽しそう！\n私達も、お話に入れてくださいな。", "zh": "呵呵，你们好像聊得很开心！\n也让我们加入吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "db4a49152a32dbc6622e111c051a22ce1a0d99a975470ec12ff8f3f05a749f46", "ja": "またそうして、幼気な子に益体もないことを……\n本気にされてしまったら、どうするつもりなのですか？", "zh": "你又在说一些对小孩子没有帮助的内容……\n如果她们当真，那该怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f0783ee8c3f962b21e622059bec5935142dae0df1e682c370af8da7163779d14", "ja": "いや、俺は本気のつもりだぞ？", "zh": "不，我是认真的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d2ba9c31487c928a2c5b5cc4b49603f814cea05d7e691a5675a2ec6179942943", "ja": "では、デビュー間もない新人アイドルばかりの私達に、\n途方もない重荷を背負わせようと……？", "zh": "意思是，你打算让我们这些才出道没多久的新人偶像，\n背负起不合理的沉重负担吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0ef6e05a0ba4bede15124da44537d2d74fe885d3e043943a57461a43af27af8e", "ja": "い、いや、そういうわけじゃなくて。\n目標……いや、希望だと思ってほしいかな。", "zh": "不、不是，我不是这个意思。\n目标……不对，是希望你们有这样的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d23381a5aec69c187ef036240a5ce6a95308e399d491d64c47b63f19ed7569a0", "ja": "そういう意味合いでしたら、\n最初からそうおっしゃってください。", "zh": "如果你是这个意思，\n请一开始就这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "a3a506c6b56bde82478bf14221d2ccc7ec85c7da86b952a54a221e4ef87afa7e", "ja": "うふふっ、そうね。\nせっかくだもの。夢は、大きく持ちましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。\n机会难得，一起怀抱远大的梦想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "297ef269557e543dd864a8f2e573bb04af9bc5bc7fe546d48c581ecbe27c27cf", "ja": "じゃあ、わたし、ツアーとかしてみたいです！\nツアーって、いろんなところに行けるんですよね？", "zh": "那我想要试试看巡演！\n巡演可以去很多不同的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "79f09eac99fab174ad4c07ea48ee72a628c614bd2f0e1b2ab8df743aae592426", "ja": "いいね、ツアー！\nあっ、それなら外国とか、行けちゃうのかも！？", "zh": "巡演听起来很棒耶！\n啊，这样说不定还可以去国外喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1026_052kao", "source_sha256": "89f6568975aa8ff63072a4f02fc184c9dd5a56c1d546a904d10d53da22de8c8b", "ja": "ふふっ、みんな、すごい夢ね！\n静香ちゃんは？", "zh": "呵呵，大家的梦想都很棒喔！\n那静香呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "f21eeee1fafbc0e97ee88be833dde1016c7280cada2ec17bea6874dc920a119e", "ja": "えっ、えっ、私？\nわ、私は、その……ええと……。", "zh": "咦、咦，我吗？\n我、我那个……就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a684383f1a54da5b287d32038b069b8cd2822d5dc24515a692164e92efe21013", "ja": "はは、そんなに焦らなくても大丈夫だよ、静香。\n大きな夢に向かって一歩ずつ、着実に進んでいこう！", "zh": "哈哈，不用急着回答也没关系，静香。\n我们就一步步朝着远大的梦想，脚踏实地向前迈进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "f19369915230b8a4ea1e4b83e62591451c8824a95035e0e13b88fee58d8c7513", "ja": "……は、はい……。", "zh": "……好、好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1030_p", "source_sha256": "fb3d2ecd0c2e8dbca49a5eaddcdfd49ae2c27b0298e141a50ba612925e91655c", "ja": "それじゃ、まずは日々のお仕事をこなすところからな。\nみんな、レッスンルームで先生が待ってるぞ！", "zh": "既然这么决定了，首先就从完成每天的工作开始。\n各位，老师在练习室等你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "8a7d73749b1a9ab0c026d0a38bdd6ad5cee3a624cbfc212b29287cba389dad21", "ja": "えっ？　……きゃあっ、大変！？", "zh": "咦……呀，糟糕！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1032_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c98d7efabfa3e3fc16b4b361e9fd60b2e10b4c05ad593269179140d93f1201ff", "ja": "も、もうそんな時間……！？", "zh": "已、已经这么晚了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "0e3ddf167b889e0b610a51fecc8b58d4e5dccc3266d3fb22fc728d08a6c11460", "ja": "い、急がないと怒られちゃう……！", "zh": "不、不赶快过去会被骂的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "872ff05f30492c697e314f3ef6f846787eafd1fac7ad01e8d5463016e7b9f933", "ja": "わたしも、いってきまーす♪\nほら、未来！　置いてっちゃうよ～？", "zh": "我也要一起去～♪\n快点，未来！我们不等你啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "e25d327495139948a44c88d93976875a16d4d859bc6fcc3897aa9d60e4be3845", "ja": "ま、待ってよ翼、静香ちゃ～ん！\nあっ、その前に……{$P$}さん！", "zh": "等、等我一下，翼、小静～！\n啊，在去之前……{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "c47b976c0b583ac8ccfa706504255925c542a85c9802a1e8b718e2fa26cdbfb2", "ja": "私達の夢、絶対、ぜーったい叶えましょうね！\nそれじゃあレッスン、いってきまーす♪", "zh": "我们的梦想，绝对、绝～对会实现的！\n那我去上训练课程啰──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1037_p", "source_sha256": "923ae5c1e81472ecb4fe8fcf6ef8d90a08ffae01ae05bae55839d8f718d08ac1", "ja": "ああ、いってこい！", "zh": "嗯嗯，快去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ead66e5bae52192368de2eeac55628b14fe5bd5347bd0075251c1a42d7618c6a", "ja": "（みんなの夢は、ひとつずつ叶えていこう。\nまずは……ここからだ！）", "zh": "（一个接着一个实现大家的梦想吧。\n首先……就从这里开始！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_010_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_010_synopsis", "source_sha256": "73d2ac417356673f51613f3e324dbb7776474428674c7b374baf450636c4d039", "ja": "次の公演は劇場のみんなで作る全体公演！\n自分たち自身の手で最高の公演にしようと、\nアイドル達は大はりきり。時に脱線しながら\nも自主的に準備を進め、見事に公演を成功さ\nせて、また新たな目標に向かっていく。", "zh": "下次的公演为剧场全员亲手打造的全体公演！\n偶像们都卯足干劲，要亲手打造最棒的公演。\n虽然她们偶尔会搞错方向，仍积极主动筹备，\n让公演顺利成功，并再次朝新的目标迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
